# **EPIC 1 — Student Onboarding & Profile Setup**

## **US 1.1 — First-time onboarding**

**As a** new student
**I want to** set up my profile, board, class, subjects, and exam goals
**So that** the app can personalize my learning journey.

### Acceptance Criteria

* Student can select:

  * Board (CBSE/ICSE/State/IB)
  * Class/Grade
  * Academic stream (Science/Commerce/Humanities)
  * Subjects
  * Target exam (Boards, NEET, JEE, CUET, etc.)
* Student can set:

  * Confidence level per subject
  * Daily available study time
  * Preferred study hours (morning/evening)
* Progress through multi-step UI with skip/resume support.
* Data is saved to `student_profile`.

### Data Needed

* `student_profile`, `student_subjects`, `student_goals`.

### Dependencies

* Supabase auth (user ID)
* Basic config tables for boards, grades, subjects.

---

## **US 1.2 — Edit learning profile**

**As a** returning student
**I want to** update my profile, goals, subjects
**So that** recommendations stay relevant.

### Acceptance Criteria

* Edit board/class/subjects/preference.
* Change target exam + target date.
* Update study preferences.
* Trigger re-generation of AI study plan.

---

## **US 1.3 — View my profile**

**As a** student
**I want to** see my academic details and activity stats
**So that** I understand my overall learning identity.

### Acceptance Criteria

* Show: name, class, board, subjects, goals.
* Show: total study time, streak, badges, recent activity.
* Button to manage account.

