# **EPIC 2 — Home Dashboard & Daily Plan**

## **US 2.1 — View personalized dashboard**

**As a** student
**I want to** see my day summarized in one place
**So that** I know what to do next.

### Acceptance Criteria

* Greeting + avatar
* Today’s classes list
* Today’s study plan (AI generated)
* Pending assignments snapshot
* Continue Learning (recent items)
* Streak + XP snapshot
* Notifications icon with count
* Quick actions: Ask Doubt, AI Study, Library, Schedule

---

## **US 2.2 — AI-generated daily study plan**

**As a** student
**I want to** get a personalized plan every day
**So that** I know exactly what to study.

### Acceptance Criteria

* Daily plan includes 3–5 tasks:

  * Videos
  * Practice sets
  * Revision tasks
  * Test preparation
* Tasks based on:

  * Subjects selected
  * Weak areas
  * Upcoming tests
  * Last activity
  * Doubts asked
* Plan updates when tasks are completed.
* Plan updates automatically at midnight or major event (test, new chapter taught).

---

## **US 2.3 — Continue learning**

**As a** student
**I want to** resume my ongoing videos, tests, chapters
**So that** I don’t lose momentum.

### Acceptance Criteria

* List last 5 active items:

  * Video with % watched
  * Test with progress
  * Chapter with progress
* Clicking resumes exactly where left off.

