# **EPIC 3 — Classes (Live & Recorded)**

## **US 3.1 — View today’s classes**

**As a** student
**I want to** see all classes happening today
**So that** I can plan my day.

### Acceptance Criteria

* Show subject, teacher, time, class type (Live/Test/Practice).
* Status badges: Live / Upcoming / Completed.
* “Join live” button.
* “View recording” for past classes.

---

## **US 3.2 — Join live class**

**As a** student
**I want to** enter a live classroom
**So that** I can attend teaching in real time.

### Acceptance Criteria

* On click, opens live session in 1–2 seconds.
* Supports:

  * Video
  * Audio
  * Screenshare
  * Whiteboard
  * Chat
  * Raise hand
  * Polls
  * Q&A
  * Breakout rooms
* Auto reconnect on network drop.
* Auto attendance after 5 minutes in class.

---

## **US 3.3 — Interact during class**

**As a** student
**I want to** chat, answer polls, vote questions, raise doubts
**So that** I remain engaged.

### Acceptance Criteria

* Chat with emojis, images.
* Anonymous or public doubts.
* Poll participation with results.
* Upvote other questions.

---

## **US 3.4 — After-class recap**

**As a** student
**I want to** get a summary after class
**So that** I can revise easily.

### Acceptance Criteria

* AI-generated summary:

  * Key points
  * Formulas
  * Questions asked
* Access class notes/resources/recordings.
* Link to related practice sets.

